{"id": "8th-u5-q614", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chera-kudanadu-vanji", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீட்டு வினாக்களை அடிப்படையாகக் கொண்டு கோடிட்ட இடங்களை நிரப்புக:\n\"சேரர்களின் நாடு __________ எனப்பட்டது; சேரர்களின் தலைநகர் __________ ஆகும்.\""}], "options": {"A": "குணநாடு, காஞ்சி", "B": "குடநாடு, வஞ்சி", "C": "கீழ்நாடு, மதுரை", "D": "தென்நாடு, உறையூர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீடு (பக். 101 கோடிட்ட இடம் 3 & சரியான விடை 1): சேரர்களின் நாடு குடநாடு எனப்பட்டது; சேரர்களின் தலைநகரம் வஞ்சி ஆகும். எனவே 'குடநாடு, வஞ்சி' என்பது சரியான விடை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the blanks based on the textbook evaluation exercises:\n\"The land of the Cheras was known as __________; the capital of the Cheras was __________.\""}], "options": {"A": "Gunanadu, Kanchi", "B": "Kudanadu, Vanji", "C": "Keezhnaadu, Madurai", "D": "Thennaadu, Uraiyur"}, "explanation": "Textbook exercises (Page 101): Chera realm was named Kudanadu; the Chera capital was Vanji. Hence 'Kudanadu, Vanji'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher"