{"id": "8th-u5-q634", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "districts-factories-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கொங்கு மாவட்டங்களை அங்குள்ள தொழிற்சாலைகள் மற்றும் தொழில் நிறுவனங்களோடு பொருத்துக:\n(a) கோயம்புத்தூர் - 1. சாயம் ஏற்றுதல் மற்றும் தோல் பதனிடுதல்\n(b) சேலம் - 2. நேதாஜி ஆயத்த ஆடைப் பூங்கா\n(c) திருப்பூர் - 3. ஜவ்வரிசி ஆலைகள் மற்றும் அலுமினியம்\n(d) ஈரோடு - 4. மின்சாரப் பொறி மற்றும் வீட்டு உபயோகப் பொருள்கள்"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "கோயம்புத்தூர் - மின்சாரப் பொருள்கள், வீட்டு உபயோகப் பொருள்கள் (4); சேலம் - ஜவ்வரிசி ஆலை, அலுமினியம் (3); திருப்பூர் - நேதாஜி ஆயத்த ஆடைப் பூங்கா (2); ஈரோடு - சாயம் ஏற்றுதல், தோல் பதனிடுதல் (1). எனவே (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1 ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Kongu districts with their key industrial establishments:\n(a) Coimbatore - 1. Dyeing and Leather Tanning\n(b) Salem - 2. Netaji Apparel Park\n(c) Tiruppur - 3. Sago (Javvarisi) mills and Aluminum\n(d) Erode - 4. Electric Motors and Domestic Appliances"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "Coimbatore - Domestic appliances and motors (4); Salem - Sago and aluminum (3); Tiruppur - Netaji Apparel Park (2); Erode - Dyeing and tanning (1). Match: (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 99, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-5", "kongu-vanigam", "factories", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u5-q635", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mountains-districts-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கொங்கு மண்டலத்தோடு தொடர்புடைய மலைகளையும் அவற்றின் அமைவிடங்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) பச்சைமலை, கொல்லிமலை - 1. கொங்கு மண்டலத்தின் தெற்கு எல்லை\n(b) சேர்வராயன் மலை / ஏற்காடு - 2. கொங்கு மண்டலத்தின் மேற்கு எல்லை\n(c) வெள்ளிமலை - 3. சேலம் மாவட்டம்\n(d) பழனிமலை - 4. நாமக்கல் மாவட்டம்"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "பச்சைமலை, கொல்லிமலை - நாமக்கல் மாவட்டம் (4); சேர்வராயன் மலை/ஏற்காடு - சேலம் மாவட்டம் (3); வெள்ளிமலை - கொங்கு மண்டலத்தின் மேற்கு எல்லை (2); பழனிமலை - கொங்கு மண்டலத்தின் தெற்கு எல்லை (1). எனவே (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1 ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the mountains connected with Kongu Mandalam with their locations/boundaries:\n(a) Pachaimalai, Kolli Hills - 1. Southern Boundary of Kongu Mandalam\n(b) Shervaroy Hills / Yercaud - 2. Western Boundary of Kongu Mandalam\n(c) Velli Malai - 3. Salem District\n(d) Palani Malai - 4. Namakkal District"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "Pachaimalai & Kolli Hills - Namakkal (4); Shervaroy/Yercaud - Salem (3); Velli Malai - Western boundary (2); Palani Malai - Southern boundary (1). Hence (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 100, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-5", "kongu-vanigam", "mountains", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u5-q636", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "grammar-irupeyarottu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மாங்கனி நகரம்', 'மஞ்சள் சந்தை' ஆகிய தொடர்களில் அமைந்துள்ள சரியான இலக்கணக் குறிப்பைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "உவமைத்தொகை", "B": "உம்மைத்தொகை", "C": "வேற்றுமைத்தொகை", "D": "இருபெயரொட்டுப் பண்புத்தொகை"}, "explanation": "'மாங்கனி நகரம்': மாங்கனி என்னும் சிறப்புப் பெயரும் நகரம் என்னும் பொதுப் பெயரும் சேர்ந்து வந்து, இடையில் 'ஆகிய' என்னும் பண்பு உருபு மறைந்து வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'இருபெயரொட்டுப் பண்புத்தொகை' ஆகும். இதேபோல் 'மஞ்சள் ஆகிய சந்தை' என்பதும் இருபெயரொட்டுப் பண்புத்தொகை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the correct grammatical category for the phrases 'Maangani Nagaram' and 'Manjal Sandhai':"}], "options": {"A": "Uvamai Thogai", "B": "Ummai Thogai", "C": "Vaetrumai Thogai", "D": "Irupeyarottu Panbutthogai"}, "explanation": "'Maangani Nagaram' and 'Manjal Sandhai' are examples of Irupeyarottu Panbutthogai (appositional bahuvrihi compounds where a specific noun prefixes a generic noun with the elision of 'aagiya')."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 100, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-5", "grammar", "irupeyarottu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u5-q637", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "grammar-sandhi-veettu-ubayogam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'வீட்டு உபயோகம்' என்னும் தொடரைச் சேர்த்துப் புணர்க்கும்போது ஏற்படும் புணர்ச்சி மாற்றத்தைக் குறிப்பிடுக:"}], "options": {"A": "வீட்டுபயோகம் (உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டோடும்)", "B": "வீட்டுஉபயோகம் (இயல்புப் புணர்ச்சி)", "C": "வீட்டூபயோகம் (நெடிலாதல்)", "D": "வீட்டிலுபயோகம் (இன் சாரியை பெறுதல்)"}, "explanation": "நிலைமொழியின் இறுதியில் குற்றியலுகரம் (வீட்டு = ட் + உ) நின்று, வருமொழி முதலில் உயிர் (உ) வருவதால் 'உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டோடும்' என்னும் விதிப்படி நிலைமொழி உகரம் கெட்டு, 'வீட் + உ' சேர்ந்து 'வீட்டுபயோகம்' எனப் புணரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Specify the sandhi change that occurs when combining the terms 'Veettu + ubayogam':"}], "options": {"A": "Veettubayogam (Elision of short 'u' before vowel)", "B": "Veettu-ubayogam (Natural unmutated sandhi)", "C": "Veettoobayogam (Lengthening)", "D": "Veettilubayogam (Addition of 'in' inflection)"}, "explanation": "'Veettu + ubayogam' combines into 'Veettubayogam' following the rule of kurriyalugaram elision where the terminal short 'u' drops off before an incoming vowel."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 99, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-5", "grammar", "punarchi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u5-q638", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u4-kalai", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "grammar-vaetrumai-thogai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மலர் உற்பத்தி', 'கைத்தறி நெசவு' ஆகிய சொற்றொடர்களில் மறைந்து வந்துள்ள வேற்றுமை உருபுகளை முறையே கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமை, நான்காம் வேற்றுமை", "B": "ஆறாம் வேற்றுமை, மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை", "C": "மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை, ஐந்தாம் வேற்றுமை", "D": "ஏழாம் வேற்றுமை, எட்டாம் வேற்றுமை"}, "explanation": "- 'மலர் உற்பத்தி' = மலரினது உற்பத்தி (ஆறாம் வேற்றுமைத் தொகை - 'அது' உருபு மறைந்துள்ளது).\n- 'கைத்தறி நெசவு' = கைத்தறியால் ஆகிய நெசவு (மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை உருபும் பயனும் உடன்தொக்க தொகை - 'ஆல்' உருபு மறைந்துள்ளது).\nஎனவே ஆறாம் வேற்றுமை, மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை என்பது சரியான விடையாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the elided case markers in the compound phrases 'Malar urpatthi' and 'Kaitthari nesavu':"}], "options": {"A": "Second case, Fourth case", "B": "Sixth case, Third case", "C": "Third case, Fifth case", "D": "Seventh case, Eighth case"}, "explanation": "'Malar urpatthi' expands to 'malarinadhu urpatthi' (6th genitive case). 'Kaitthari nesavu' expands to 'kaitthariyaal aagiya nesavu' (3rd instrumental case). Hence Sixth case, Third case."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allo