{"id": "8th-u5-q663", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "weaving-terms-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தறி நெசவுத் தொழில் சார்ந்த கருவிகளையும் அவற்றின் பணிகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) பாவு - 1. பாவு நூல் சுற்றப்படும் பெரிய உருளை பீம்\n(b) தார்க்கதிர் - 2. துணியின் டிசைனைத் தீர்மானிக்கும் சாதனம்\n(c) ஜக்கார்டு - 3. ஊடு நூலை எலி மாதிரி சுமந்து செல்லும் கருவி\n(d) பாவு பீம் - 4. தறியில் நெடுக ஓடும் நீள் இழை நூல்"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "பாவு: நீள் இழை நூல் (4); தார்க்கதிர்: ஊடு நூல் சுமந்து எலி மாதிரி ஓடும் கருவி (3); ஜக்கார்டு: துணியின் டிசைனைத் தீர்மானிக்கும் சாதனம் (2); பாவு பீம்: நூல் சுற்றப்பட்ட பெரிய உருளை (1). எனவே (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1 ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the textile weaving components with their technical descriptions:\n(a) Paavu (Warp) - 1. Large cylindrical beam wound with warp yarn\n(b) Thaarkadhir (Shuttle) - 2. Mechanism determining textile patterns\n(c) Jacquard - 3. Instrument running like a mouse carrying weft thread\n(d) Paavu Beam - 4. Longitudinal lengthwise warp threads on the loom"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "Paavu: Warp threads (4); Thaarkadhir: Running shuttle (3); Jacquard: Pattern device (2); Paavu Beam: Warp cylinder (1). Match: (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 105, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-5", "kaalam-udan-varum", "weaving", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u5-q664", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "grammar-textbook-eval-q2", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீட்டு வினா: \"'கரையில் சேர்ப்பான்' என்பது எவ்வகை வினையாகும்?\""}], "options": {"A": "செய்வினை", "B": "செயப்பாட்டு வினை", "C": "தன்வினை", "D": "பிறவினை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீடு (பக். 109 சரியான விடை 2): 'சேர்ந்தான்' என்பது தன்வினை; 'சேர்ப்பான்' என்பது பிறரைக் கொண்டு செய்விக்கும் வினை என்பதால் 'பிறவினை' ஆகும். எனவே சரியான விடை 'பிறவினை'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Textbook Evaluation Question: \"'Karaiyil serppaan' belongs to which category of verb?\""}], "options": {"A": "Seivinai (Active Voice)", "B": "Seyappattu Vinai (Passive Voice)", "C": "Thanvinai (Direct Action)", "D": "Piravinai (Causative Action)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Evaluation (Page 109, Q2): 'Serndhaan' is Thanvinai; 'Serppaan' (will cause to reach/deliver) is a causative verb, making it Piravinai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 109, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-5", "grammar", "piravinai", "textbook-eval"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u5-q665", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "grammar-textbook-eval-q1", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீட்டு வினா: \"எழுவாய் ஒரு வினையைத் தானே செய்தால் அது __________ எனப்படும்.\""}], "options": {"A": "தன்வினை", "B": "பிறவினை", "C": "செய்வினை", "D": "செயப்பாட்டு வினை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீடு (பக். 109 சரியான விடை 1): எழுவாய் ஒரு வினையைத் தானே செய்தால் அது 'தன்வினை' எனப்படும். எழுவாய் வினையைப் பிறரைக் கொண்டு செய்வித்தால் அது பிறவினை எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Textbook Evaluation Question: \"When the Subject performs an action directly, it is termed __________.\""}], "options": {"A": "Thanvinai", "B": "Piravinai", "C": "Seivinai", "D": "Seyappattu Vinai"}, "explanation": "Textbook Evaluation (Page 109, Q1): When the Subject carries out the action directly by itself, it is termed Thanvinai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 109, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-5", "grammar", "thanvinai", "textbook-eval"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u5-q666", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "grammar-textbook-eval-q3", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீட்டு வினா: \"'பாடல் இலக்கியாவால் பாடப்பட்டது' என்பது எவ்வகைத் தொடர்?\""}], "options": {"A": "செய்வினைத் தொடர்", "B": "செயப்பாட்டு வினைத் தொடர்", "C": "தன்வினைத் தொடர்", "D": "பிறவினைத் தொடர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீடு (பக். 109 வினா 3): இத்தொடரில் செயப்படுபொருளான பாடல் முதன்மைப்படுத்தப்பட்டு, எழுவாயோடு 'ஆல்' என்ற மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை உருபும் பயனிலையோடு 'பட்டது' என்ற துணைவினையும் சேர்ந்து வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'செயப்பாட்டு வினைத் தொடர்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Textbook Evaluation Question: \"'Paadal Ilakkiyavaal paadappattadhu' represents which type of sentence?\""}], "options": {"A": "Seivinai Thodar (Active Voice)", "B": "Seyappattu Vinai Thodar (Passive Voice)", "C": "Thanvinai Thodar (Direct Verb)", "D": "Piravinai Thodar (Causative Verb)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Evaluation (Page 109, Q3): Because the Object 'paadal' is fronted, the Subject takes 'aal', and the predicate features 'pattadhu', this is a Seyappattu Vinai (Passive Voice) sentence."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 109, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-5", "grammar", "seyappattu-vinai", "textbook-eval"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u5-q667", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "grammar-voice-transformation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீட்டுப் பயிற்சி: 'மாணவர்கள் வகுப்பைத் தூய்மை செய்தனர்' என்னும் செய்வினைத் தொடருக்கு இணையான சரியான செயப்பாட்டு வினைத் தொடர் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "வகுப்பு மாணவர்களால் தூய்மை செய்கிறது", "B": "மாணவர்கள் வகுப்பால் தூய்மை செய்யப்பட்டனர்", "C": "வகுப்பு மாணவர்களால் தூய்மை செய்யப்பட்டது", "D": "வகுப்பை மாணவர்கள் தூய்மை செய்வித்தனர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பயிற்சி (பக். 109 வினா 1): செய்வினையைச் செயப்பாட்டு வினையாக மாற்றும்போது:\n1. செயப்படுபொருள் (வகுப்பு) எழுவாயாக மாறும்.\n2. எழுவாயோடு 'ஆல்' சேரும் (மாணவர்களால்).\n3. பயனிலையோடு பட்டது சேரும் (தூய்மை செய்யப்பட்டது).\nஎனவே 'வகுப்பு மாணவர்களால் தூய்மை செய்யப்பட்டது' என்பதே சரியான மாற்றமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Textbook Evaluation Exercise: What is the correct Passive Voice equivalent of the Active Voice sentence 'Maanavargal vaguppait thooimai seidhanar'?"}], "options": {"A": "Vaguppu maanavargalaal thooimai seigiradhu", "B": "Maanavargal vaguppaal thooimai seiyyappattanar", "C": "Vaguppu maanavargalaal thooimai seiyyappattadhu", "D": "Vaguppai maanavargal thooimai seivithanar"}, "explanation": "Textbook exercise (Page 109, Q1): When transforming active to passive: Object 'vaguppu' moves to the front, Subject takes 'aal' ('maanavargalaal'), and verb incorporates 'pattadhu' ('thooimai seiyyappattadhu')."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "