{"id": "8th-u5-q686", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "bird-sound-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பறவைகளையும் அவற்றிற்குரிய மரபான ஒலிகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) ஆந்தை - 1. கொக்கரிக்கும்\n(b) கூகை - 2. குனுகும்\n(c) புறா - 3. குழறும்\n(d) கோழி - 4. அலறும்"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4"}, "explanation": "ஒலிமரபு: ஆந்தை அலறும் (4); கூகை குழறும் (3); புறா குனுகும் (2); கோழி கொக்கரிக்கும் (1). எனவே (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1 ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the birds with their conventional Tamil sounds:\n(a) Aandhai (Owl) - 1. Kokkarikkum\n(b) Koogai (Barn Owl) - 2. Kunugum\n(c) Puraa (Pigeon) - 3. Kuzharum\n(d) Kozhi (Hen) - 4. Alarum"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4"}, "explanation": "Sound conventions: Aandhai alarum (4); Koogai kuzharum (3); Puraa kunugum (2); Kozhi kokkarikkum (1). Sequence: (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "s