{"id": "8th-u5-q687", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "action-marabu-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருள்களையும் அவற்றிற்குரிய வினைமரபுச் சொற்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) சோறு - 1. வனை\n(b) முறுக்கு - 2. கொய்\n(c) பூ - 3. தின்\n(d) பானை - 4. உண்"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "வினைமரபு: சோறு உண் (4); முறுக்கு தின் (3); பூக் கொய் (2); பானை வனை (1). எனவே சரியான பொருத்தம் (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1 ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the objects with their conventional action verbs (Vinai Marabu):\n(a) Sōru (Cooked Rice) - 1. Vanai (Shape)\n(b) Murukku - 2. Koy (Pluck)\n(c) Poo (Flower) - 3. Thin (Snack/Munch)\n(d) Paanai (Pot) - 4. Un (Consume/Eat)"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "Action verbs: Sōru un (4); Murukku thin (3); Poo koy (2); Paanai vanai (1). Correct match: (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": 