{"id": "8th-u5-q690", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "glossary-textile-terms-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலக் கலைச்சொற்களுக்கு இணையான சரியான தமிழ்ச் சொற்களைப் பொருத்துக:\n(a) Loom - 1. ஆயத்த ஆடை\n(b) Dyeing - 2. தோல் பதனிடுதல்\n(c) Tanning - 3. சாயம் ஏற்றுதல்\n(d) Readymade Dress - 4. தறி"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "கலைச்சொற்கள் (பக். 112): Loom - தறி (4); Dyeing - சாயம் ஏற்றுதல் (3); Tanning - தோல் பதனிடுதல் (2); Readymade Dress - ஆயத்த ஆடை (1). எனவே (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1 ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the English technical words with their exact Tamil equivalents:\n(a) Loom - 1. Aayattha Aadai\n(b) Dyeing - 2. Thol Padanidudhal\n(c) Tanning - 3. Saayam Aetrudhal\n(d) Readymade Dress - 4. Thari"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "Vocabulary (Page 112): Loom - Thari (4); Dyeing - Saayam aetrudhal (3); Tanning - Thol padanidudhal (2); Readymade Dress - Aayattha aadai (1). Match: (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_q