{"id": "8th-u5-q691", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u5-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "glossary-industry-terms-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலக் கலைச்சொற்களையும் அவற்றிற்குரிய தமிழ்ச் சொற்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) Stitch - 1. நூல்\n(b) Factory - 2. பால்பண்ணை\n(c) Dairy farm - 3. ஆலை\n(d) Thread - 4. தையல்"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "கலைச்சொற்கள் (பக். 112): Stitch - தையல் (4); Factory - ஆலை (3); Dairy farm - பால்பண்ணை (2); Thread - நூல் (1). எனவே (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1 ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the English terms with their appropriate Tamil translations:\n(a) Stitch - 1. Nool\n(b) Factory - 2. Paalpannai\n(c) Dairy farm - 3. Aalai\n(d) Thread - 4. Thaiyal"}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "Glossary (Page 112): Stitch - Thaiyal (4); Factory - Aalai (3); Dairy farm - Paalpannai (2); Thread - Nool (1). Match: (a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options"